    A[External Pi Level]:::red --> B{Is External Pi Low?}:::orange

    B -- "Yes" --> C[Pst System Activity Decreased]:::blue
    C --> D["\Pst System (sensor) Inactive"]:::blue
    D --> E["PhoR (Histidine Kinase)"]:::yellow
    E --> F[PhoR Autophosphorylation]:::green
    F --> G(\1):::blue
    G --> H["PhoB (Response Regulator)"]:::yellow
    G --> I[PhoR-P transfers P to PhoB]:::green
    I --> J(\1):::blue
    J --> K[PhoB-P binds to Pho boxes]:::green
    K --> L{Activation of Pho Regulon Genes}:::lavender
    L --> M["Increased Pi Uptake Genes (e.g., Pst, Pit)"]:::violet
    L --> N["Increased Pi Scavenging Genes (e.g., PhoA, UgpB)"]:::violet
    L --> O[Increased Membrane Remodeling Genes]:::violet
    L --> P[RpoS Induction]:::violet

    M --> Q[Enhanced Pi Uptake]:::green
    N --> S[Phosphate Scavenging]:::green
    O --> U[Replacement of Phospholipids]:::green
    P --> W[General Stress Response Activation]:::violet

    Q --> R[Intracellular Pi from Uptake]:::blue
    S --> T[Liberation of Pi from Organic Sources]:::blue
    U --> V[Conservation of Intracellular Pi]:::blue

    R --> AX["Intracellular Pi Pool (General)"]:::blue
    T --> AX
    V --> AX
    W --> X[Adaptation to Pi Starvation]:::violet
    AX --> X

    B -- "No" --> Y[Normal/High External Pi]:::red
    Y --> Z["Pst System (sensor) Active"]:::blue
    Z --> AA[/Inhibition of PhoR Autophosphorylation/]:::green
    AA --> AB[\Pho Regulon Inactive/]:::violet

    Y --> AC[High Intracellular Pi]:::blue
    AX -- "High Pi State" --> AC
    AC --> AD[Impact on PTS Phosphorylation]:::green
    AD --> AE{Is Glucose Available?}:::orange
    AE -- "Yes" --> AF["PTS Components Phosphorylated (EI-P, HPr-P, EIIA^Glc-P)"]:::blue
    AF --> AG[Sugar Uptake via PTS]:::green

    AE -- "No or High Pi" --> AH[Accumulation of EIIA^Glc-P-free]:::blue
    AH --> AI["Adenylate Cyclase (CyaA)"]:::yellow
    AI --> AJ["Activation of Adenylate Cyclase (CyaA)"]:::green
    AJ --> AK[ATP Input for CyaA]:::red
    AK --> AL[CyaA converts ATP to cAMP]:::green
    AL --> AM[Increased cAMP Levels]:::blue
    AM --> AN["Crp (Cyclic AMP Receptor Protein)"]:::yellow
    AM --> AO[cAMP binds to Crp]:::green
    AO --> AP[cAMP-Crp Complex]:::blue
    AP --> AQ{Global Gene Regulation by cAMP-Crp}:::lavender
    AQ --> AR[Activation of Carbon Catabolism Genes]:::violet
    AQ --> AS[/Repression of Specific Stress Response Genes/]:::violet
    AQ --> AT[Activation of Stress-mediated Death Pathway Genes]:::violet

    AT --> AU[Cell Death Pathway Triggered]:::violet
    AC --> AV[Potential Pi Toxicity]:::blue
    AU --> AW[Reduced Cell Viability]:::violet
    AV --> AW

    AX --> BA["Synthesis of Polyphosphate (PolyP)"]:::green
    AY[ATP for PolyP Synthesis]:::red --> BA
    AZ["Polyphosphate Kinase (PPK)"]:::yellow --> BA
    BA --> BB["PolyP Storage (Pi Reserve)"]:::blue

    BB --> BC["Polyphosphate Exopolyphosphatase (PPX)"]:::yellow
    BC --> BD[/Degradation of PolyP/]:::green
    BD --> BE[Release of Intracellular Pi from PolyP]:::blue
    BE --> AX

    BF["Pyridoxal (PL)"]:::red --> BI[PL + ATP -> PLP + ADP Reaction]:::green
    BG[ATP for PLP Synthesis]:::red --> BI
    BH[Pyridoxal Kinase]:::yellow --> BI
    BI --> BJ["Pyridoxal 5'-Phosphate (PLP)"]:::blue
    BJ --> BK[/PLP Feedback Inhibits Pyridoxal Kinase/]:::green
    BK --> BH
    BJ --> BL[Regulation of PLP Levels]:::violet


